1
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:12,260
Events and Message collects everything the server reports: logins, deals, margin warnings and messages.

2
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:16,120
Click an event to read all of it below.

3
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:20,980
Price Alerts lists your alerts. Add one by right-clicking an instrument in Rates & Charts.

4
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,840
News shows the latest market headlines.

5
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:30,500
At the bottom, the STP logs list the orders passed on to your liquidity providers: filled ones on the left, the ones that failed on the right.

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:38,280
Look-back sets how many hours they cover.

7
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:43,940
Symbol Exposure is your net position in each instrument: deals, average price, net lots and exposure, swaps, commissions and profit.

8
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:50,480
TOTAL at the top adds up the whole book.

9
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:53,340
Search to find an instrument.

10
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:56,340
Export CSV saves the table for a spreadsheet.

